{"id": "section-body-17836", "title": "Aphthous Ulceration", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-17836", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Aphthous Ulceration", "runs": [{"text": "Aphthous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ulceration"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1126"}}, {"id": "body-17837", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Aphthous or recurrent aphthous stomatitis (RAS) or recurrent aphthous ulceration (RAU) are painful recurrent mucous membrane ulcerations. Usually affect the non-keratinized oral mucous membrane. (Buccal, labial, floor of the mouth, soft palate, ventral surface of the tongue, and alveolar mucosa.", "runs": [{"text": "Aphthous or recurrent aphthous stomatitis (RAS) or recurrent aphthous ulceration (RAU) are painful recurrent mucous membrane"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ulcerations."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Usually"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "affect"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "non-keratinized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mucous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "membrane."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Buccal,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "labial,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "floor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mouth,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "soft"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "palate, ventral surface of the tongue, and alveolar mucosa."}]}, {"id": "body-17839", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-17840", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Minor Aphthous Ulcers", "runs": [{"text": "Minor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Aphthous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ulcers"}]}, {"id": "body-17841", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Sudden onset, small round or ovoid painful ulcers 2–4 mm in diameter, surrounded by an erythematous halo and some edema.", "runs": [{"text": "Sudden onset, small round or ovoid painful ulcers 2–4 mm in diameter, surrounded by an erythematous halo and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "some edema."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1114"}}, {"id": "body-17842", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Occurs in groups of only a few ulcers (i.e. 1–6) at a time.", "runs": [{"text": "Occurs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "groups"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "only"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "few"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ulcers"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(i.e."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1–6)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "time."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1114"}}, {"id": "body-17844", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Major Aphthous ulcers", "runs": [{"text": "Major"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Aphthous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ulcers"}]}, {"id": "body-17845", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Painful ulcers on non-keratinized oral mucous membrane, they are large 1–3 cm edged ulcers, and several may be present simultaneously.", "runs": [{"text": "Painful ulcers on non-keratinized oral mucous membrane, they are large 1–3 cm edged ulcers, and several may be present simultaneously."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1114"}}, {"id": "body-17847", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Herpetiform ulcers", "runs": [{"text": "Herpetiform"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ulcers"}]}, {"id": "body-17848", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "These occur in a group of multiple tiny ulcers (<1–3 mm) which can coalesce into larger irregular ulcers which heals within 7–10days.", "runs": [{"text": "These occur in a group of multiple tiny ulcers (<1–3 mm) which can coalesce into larger irregular ulcers which heals within 7–10days."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1114"}}, {"id": "body-17850", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-17851", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "B: chlorhexidine gluconate 0.1% mouthwash used 8hourly for 5days", "runs": [{"text": "B:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "chlorhexidine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gluconate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.1%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mouthwash"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly for 5days"}]}, {"id": "body-17852", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-17853", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: povidone iodine 1% mouthwash 8hourly for 5days", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "povidone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "iodine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mouthwash"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "5days"}]}, {"id": "body-17854", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "AND", "runs": [{"text": "AND"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-17855", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: triamcinolone acetonide cream 0.1% apply 12hourly for 5days", "runs": [{"text": "C:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "triamcinolone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acetonide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cream"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.1%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "apply"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "12hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for "}, {"text": "5days"}]}, {"id": "body-17856", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-17857", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "D: dexamethasone oral paste apply 8hourly for 5 days", "runs": [{"text": "D:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "dexamethasone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "paste"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "apply"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "5"}, {"text": " days"}]}, {"id": "body-17859", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If systemic therapy is required;", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "systemic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "therapy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "required;"}]}, {"id": "body-17860", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: prednisolone (PO) 20mg 8hourly for 3days then dose tapered to 10mg 8hourly for 2days then 5mg 8hourly for other 2 days.", "runs": [{"text": "A: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "prednisolone (PO) 20mg 8hourly for 3days then dose tapered to 10mg 8hourly for 2days then 5mg 8hourly for other 2 days."}]}, {"id": "body-17862", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Pain control by analgesics", "runs": [{"text": "Pain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "control"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "analgesics"}]}, {"id": "body-17863", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: paracetamol (PO) 1g 8hourly for 3days", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "paracetamol"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1g"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3days"}]}, {"id": "body-17864", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-17865", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: diclofenac (PO) 50mg 8hourly for 3days", "runs": [{"text": "C:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "diclofenac"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "50mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3days"}]}, {"id": "body-17866", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-17867", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: ibuprofen (PO) 400mg 8hourly for 3days", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "ibuprofen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "400mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3days"}]}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Oral and maxillofacial conditions", "start": "body-17836", "end": "body-17867"}}